==Bavarian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|bar|gmh|haven}}, from {{inh|bar|goh|havan}}, {{m|goh|hafan}}. Possibly related to {{m|bar|hebn}}. Compare also {{cog|de|Häfen}}.

